 # Changelog
 
+## Unreleased
+
+- Free shipping applies at 50.00 € of items or more, counting quantities. Orders of exactly 50.00 € and orders that
+  reach 50.00 € only through quantities (three 17.00 € bottles, say) were charged shipping by mistake.
+
